<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-07T15:48:04.951Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 15:48:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces killed cross-border infiltrators in Upper Kurram and arrested Afghan Taliban members in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa. A bomb disposal official was killed by an IED in Upper South Waziristan. A bus-truck collision on the Hazara Motorway killed eight and injured thirty, while separate crashes in Abbottabad and Bhakkar killed eleven and injured thirty-three. TTP wanted commander Abu Dujana Khyberi was among five killed in operations in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa. 1,794 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQTGRyZ1FFOWdNalpDbFdEeHZqc1JMNVVkekpWT3NULUU4N0hXTkN3MTQ5dlNSWjdhaUVCWlVUQVdhbkZrOEdDZ2FlNS1qOENqVnhOWGNYcmgtSU8xN3pHUjIzdDZ5akJZNzhnR3g4U0w5NjR1NUNka204MWRxak1WN056VUQ1MEhpNnpnaWVGSF90RlBMaTBWY1R5NFJDa3Q0SE1rMDhUUHRJZ01EMDJHdkhqMTY5aFU5TGd6WTNsekRoQkcyUkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQd21RU1NkQTBzcWZoSHcxZGdQNnJhZ2ktb1BadFNLcDdsMUN0M0dabEFidU8tSFpUb2xYOUlsbDNHbmFxVlJwQjBRNnF3Y0ZhbC1CQVYzMTdwT0lsRExZYjdmN1JNVjJvRlVIcnRBRDhWSHE3NlBBRDYxbDBNM1FxZDF5Mk9Rdm5xMm5nS09tRFlrMW9XT0lSOUJvZjFFcXJn?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9TTjhoazE2U0lDMi1aXzlRWWRqcVJtQVhvZmdFNlR2Vk5hWTFOcEpIUzZpMC1pbnBhbjBWNXJxWkFUS3JDWUhaMQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOM204Y29UdHV2cFNodnVRQUNyc3pfZThjMzdqdVlvSV93WHdYSngxelJ3cWZ1X29qS0RlZEZOcVF0ZUkyc3IzRlJNTTRfa1JZTnMzeUo4c0RJdktIWVlNSnUxU0V5Q19NQkpLVDkzeFlRa3VGR0JqdVZrcHo3X2lJQ0RXTGdMaTVKdTJVY09ydWowWnU2bE9xNWhZeFozSTQ5enkxbVU5UjNqWTIxQ0tIaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mashriq TV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNMTVNV2RQY2Zka3pubXM2M2NFMDVXX1o0amJPRU9mbVVEZ